{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free demo gives you a taste of the adventure with the first 2 chapters of the game, featuring 2 levels, 1 boss fight, a mini-game, and cutscenes that introduce the story and setting. The full release is planned for the first quarter of 2026 \u2014 stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/8727667c1e4541d3c977fcd034110c9f.avif?t=1761918470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras_big/8727667c1e4541d3c977fcd034110c9f.webp?t=1761918470 width=1560 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.poster.avif?t=1761918470\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.webm?t=1761918470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.mp4?t=1761918470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join MIRAI #167 and Jonas, two characters separated by time but united in soul\u2014switch between them to use each character\u2019s unique abilities to overcome and defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/b934a6c573a45c4e3bafdb92287e73fa.avif?t=1761918470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras_big/b934a6c573a45c4e3bafdb92287e73fa.webp?t=1761918470 width=1560 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.poster.avif?t=1761918470\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.webm?t=1761918470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.mp4?t=1761918470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat and pass through enemies in a variety of ways: engage in melee combat, deflect gunfire back at them, throw objects from the environment, or rely on classic runner moves like jumping, sliding, and dashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/d3ef5bd84a647f9dc78096be845bda68.avif?t=1761918470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras_big/d3ef5bd84a647f9dc78096be845bda68.webp?t=1761918470 width=1560 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/c33b955d0078daa54e5bcd3d3a966051.poster.avif?t=1761918470\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/c33b955d0078daa54e5bcd3d3a966051.webm?t=1761918470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861660/extras/c33b955d007